{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blitzr Ball has a classic arcade style feel with 8 bit graphics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player Skill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the left and right arrow keys to keep the blitzr ball from falling off the screen.\u00a0As you play, bouncing the blitzr ball off of blocks, the blitzr ball gets faster. This means reaction time is key especially in later more challenging levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Block Types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are multiple types of blocks along the way, discover how they interact with the blitzr ball, what is hiding inside of some of them, and how to rack up the most points with them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accumulate points by playing levels. These points are then used to buy items and perks in the store!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase helpful perks with points in the store. Perks such as extra life and platform extension can be used in levels to help get an advantage. Combine perks together to mix and match how you play. Try all combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Power ups</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Look for the green blocks in levels to spawn a powerup. These will greatly increase your chance of beating tricky levels. Power ups such as the multiball split every active blitzr ball into 2 making the level more chaotic and fun. Double points power ups temporarily increase all points earned by 2x. These are useful when you are saving up for a flashy new bumper to unlock in the store.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Store</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you beat levels, points accumulated can be used to purchase custom bumpers, perks, blitz balls, and more! Try to unlock everything using those points!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Blitzr Basics","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578180/752231210769d1ae2b033cb4a0ca0e391074118c.jpg"},{"name":"Blitzr Ballin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578180/44e3a2a693b3a19d2ce9ce62a61f2be0fea50269.jpg"},{"name":"Blitzr Blaze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578180/6b561cf884477b1e6916355d3d4efbbe6751f166.jpg"},{"name":"Now This Is Blitzr Ball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578180/fc1b7d78badffbfd27d699f17360b00c74e27eca.jpg"},{"name":"Blitzr Ball Forever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578180/3dbc1bdb48eaed48fef2b404d3b8cac76ddbc454.jpg"},{"name":"This Will Help","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578180/430f6c07513d4f24d6c766b0ae13e9a07c704136.jpg"},{"name":"Perk Sampler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578180/a0504d51c168ad048cdf4cb3788c1f080768af4f.jpg"},{"name":"Don't Need No Tutorial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578180/6e0075bf52d2acac66c5a2b116a7349fef88b543.jpg"},{"name":"Blitzr Boss Bested","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578180/a0b007a188092103274885d9d104701683956409.jpg"},{"name":"Blitzr In Style","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578180/f2d3822c67714af48444ecddccc005c1a813e93d.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578180?t=1744046067","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578180